# The after stage of the guide to writing a package: the package is in the
# editor, and config imports its module `WordCount`. Config binds a key to
# the package's command and names the package's `WordCount.count` in a
# command of its own; the key and that command both run. It touches no file.

reload
settle

key i KeyI -
commit one two  three
key <Escape> Escape -
key c KeyC control
key w KeyW -
scene
run word-count-scratch
scene
